# n8n Lint

Uses `eslint-plugin-n8n-nodes-base` for community node compliance.

Run ESLint before committing. Follow n8n node base class requirements:

- Correct `description` fields on node properties
- Proper `displayOptions` show/hide logic
- Valid credential references
